"source":"original","mtime":"1552951225","size":"4815","md5":"930895b711c8386e7d0c5940ca77284a","crc32":"135a2baa","sha1":"78647824a9e240e90f6a93fce02f90bd75bf48e6","format":"Item Tile","rotation":"0"},{"name":"radia_s24_n284_radiocampus_semantik_radiosonic.afpk","source":"derivative","format":"Columbia Peaks","original":"radia_s24_n284_radiocampus_semantik_radiosonic.mp3","mtime":"1492336449","size":"336928","md5":"124af2c0e095086849996dbe45afc947","crc32":"8e5be6e4","sha1":"ff0f6c06348aba1e3b47fb64db0746a131e2c357"},{"name":"radia_s24_n284_radiocampus_semantik_radiosonic.mp3","source":"original","size":"69843272","format":"VBR MP3","title":"#284 : Semantik live at Radio Sonic 2010","creator":"Semantik","album":"Radia Season 24","track":"284","mtime":"1284210263","md5":"29c16aa4ae7c7d4dde44267fcdd3eaea","crc32":"dbb44fcb","sha1":"0172d37aae2b6e1ac743e5cd79d554908be42c2d","length":"1746.05","height":"0","width":"0","external-identifier-match-date":"acoustid:2019-03-18T21:08:33Z","external-identifier":"urn:acoustid:c528ecc1-022e-4afc-a232-afa145d9b1fc"},{"name":"radia_s24_n284_radiocampus_semantik_radiosonic.ogg","source":"derivative","format":"Ogg Vorbis","original":"radia_s24_n284_radiocampus_semantik_radiosonic.mp3","mtime":"1492336358","size":"20326485","md5":"c4dee4191f54100f9193a269eb1623a7","crc32":"4b3d934b","sha1":"dabd03610964cd6db855be40ddeea8b082a44586","length":"1746","height":"0","width":"0"},{"name":"radia_s24_n284_radiocampus_semantik_radiosonic.png","source":"derivative","format":"PNG","original":"radia_s24_n284_radiocampus_semantik_radiosonic.mp3","mtime":"1492336411","size":"11104","md5":"7dec82efaf7208c072d05cebe8addaa4","crc32":"72186b3c","sha1":"1f9fc05963caf8aeef3a4b37310b44e85282e2ff"}],"files_count":13,"item_last_updated":1708990135,"item_size":90557154,"metadata":{"identifier":"RadiaSeason024284","title":"Show 0284: Semantik live at Radio Sonic 2010 by Semantik (Radio Campus)","mediatype":"audio","collection":["radiafm","radioprograms","radiostationarchives"],"description":"This is radio show # 284 of season 24 of the <a href=\"http://www.radia.fm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Radia</a> weekly comissioned radio art programs. It was submited by <a href=\"http://www.radiocampusbruxelles.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">Radio Campus</a>. \nIt was broadcasted in all Radia stations in the week of 5 to 11 September 2010. \n<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Read about Radia on wikipedia.</a>\n\n--\n\nSemantik live at Radio Sonic 2010\n\nThis show is a live performance made during Radio Sonic, the 4 days long webradio that Radio Campus Bruxelles operated the previous week, to announce a sound art festival in Belgium called <a href=\"http://www.citysonic.be\" rel=\"nofollow\">City Sonic</a>.\n\nIn the place we were working (Les anciens abattoirs), we met a sound artist working with devices that interrogate our relation to the body and territories. Audio Geolocalised derive &amp; sound installation. He kept sounds he made and transformed to create this live performance one night. Here's the copyleft result.\n\nMember of the collectif APO33, he's also performing as live dj with experimental breakcore set, under the name of Semantik.\n\n<a href=\"http://semantik.free.fr/wordpress\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://semantik.free.fr/wordpress</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.myspace.com/abruitsecret\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.myspace.com/abruitsecret</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.apo33.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.apo33.org</a>","date":"2010-09-06","year":"2010","subject":"radio art;Radia;Radio Campus","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","publicdate":"2010-09-11 14:17:23","addeddate":"2010-09-11 12:51:33","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","updater":["Radia.fm","Radia.fm","Radia.fm","Radia.fm","Radia.fm","Radia.fm"],"updatedate":["2010-09-11 14:24:02","2010-09-11 14:29:14","2010-09-11 14:29:42","2010-09-11 14:35:20","2010-09-13 22:38:36","2010-09-14 18:57:39"],"boxid":"OL100020608","backup_location":"ia903606_12","creator":"Radio Campus","radiaseason":"24"},"server":"ia801309.us.archive.org","uniq":880771135,"workable_servers":["ia801309.us.archive.org","ia601309.us.archive.org"]}